<section>
  <h1>The users to keep in mind</h1>
  <ul>
    <li>People with visual impairments: blind, low vision, color blindness</li>
    <li>People with hearing impairments: Deaf or hard of hearing</li>
    <li>
      People with motor impairments: no use of hands, lack of strength, tremors,
      ...
    </li>
    <li>
      People with cognitive impairments: dyslexia, ADHD, intellectual
      disability,...
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
